                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game has been fun, its very cute and the story is really interesting. I've been very sad that I cannot complete the game though due to a common game bug with putting the Fosfos in the parachute. One of the three disappears if placed in parachute too fast. I cannot go back to a previous save and redo it either. This game would be even better if I could complete it; I hope that they put out a update to fix that bug soon.",
